  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">swissREPAT-IOM-Movements (SIM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at supporting migrants who are willing to return voluntarily to their countries of origin. Different schemes of assistance are offered to migrants during their return journey both in Switzerland, the country of transit, and the country of return. Moreover, IOM will organize specific assistance for person in situation of vulnerability upon request.</narrative>
  </description>
